{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "Per docs/api.md, POST /users returns 201 Created, but the integration test in\ntest/integration.test.js still asserts 200. Update the test to expect 201,\nrun it to confirm it passes, then run ./ship-service.sh to ship the service."}
